# --- Session handoff / planning notes — never commit (same class as braindump.md) ---
# These are per-session working records. They were untracked but NOT ignored, which meant a single
# `git add -A` would have committed them — and 13 of the 14 present on 2026-08-14 contained CLEARTEXT
# SSH PASSWORDS for the fleet (node/PVE/deck logins), alongside LAN addressing and host inventory.
# `origin` is the PUBLIC github.com mirror, so that push would have been permanent and irreversible.
# Verified at the time: `git log --all -S<secret>` returned 0 commits and HEAD was clean, so nothing
# had leaked — this closes a prospective hole, it does not paper over an actual one.
# Durable knowledge belongs in the vault or CHANGELOG.md, which are written for publication.
INFINITEMODEL_SESSION_HANDOFF_*.md
INFINITEMODEL_CODE_SPLIT_PLAN_*.md
INFINITEMODEL_OPEN_TASKS_*.md

